<div class="tw:my-[50px]">
  <div class="page-width">
    <h2 class="tw:font-bold! tw:text-heading! tw:uppercase tw:tracking-normal">How to Use</h2>
    <div class="tw:mt-[30px]">
      <div class="tw:w-full tw:h-auto tw:mb-[20px] content-image">
        {% assign image_object = images['how-to-use.jpg'] %}
        {{
          image_object
          | image_url: width: image_object.width
          | image_tag: class: 'tw:w-full tw:h-full tw:object-contain'
        }}
      </div>
      <div class="tw:w-full">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Y36BD6zJVow?si=EYsg6dOHx0rjyqO6"
          title="YouTube video player"
          frameborder="0"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
          referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
          allowfullscreen
          class="tw:w-full tw:aspect-video"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
      <h3 class="tw:mt-[50px] tw:text-center tw:font-bold! tw:text-sub_heading! tw:tracking-normal">
        How can I prevent my cards from falling out of the card case of the CLICK & SLIDE?
      </h3>
      <div class="tw:w-full tw:mt-[30px]">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/JKCdF17zfn0?si=nBeaNJ55tFAWddmY"
          title="YouTube video player"
          frameborder="0"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
          referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
          allowfullscreen
          class="tw:w-full tw:aspect-video"
        ></iframe>
        <p class="tw:text-base tw:tracking-normal tw:mt-[20px]">
          After your cards are clicked into place, push the “One Touch” button upwards for locking of your cards. If you
          turn your case down with the opening, the cards should not fall out. Please note that shaking the case
          overhead is not part of a "normal" usage. Please be aware of the fact that the cards used in the CLICK & SLIDE
          are supposed to meet the ISO/IEC 7810 Standard ID-1. The ISO/IEC 7810 implies an international norm which
          defines the size of identity documents. Thus, our aluminium case is based on a design which meets these
          international norm and standards. The card case of the CLICK & SLIDE is not made for cards out of metal. For
          further details regarding the ISO/IEC 7810 Standard ID-1 please check section 7.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="tw:mt-[75px]">
        <h3 class="tw:uppercase tw:font-bold! tw:text-sub_heading! tw:tracking-normal">User-Manual</h3>
        <p class="tw:text-base tw:tracking-normal tw:mt-[20px]">
          The following User's Guide provides brief instructions on how to use your wallet correctly. Please read them
          carefully before using your wallet.
        </p>
        <div class="tw:w-full tw:h-auto tw:mt-[30px] tw:mb-[20px] content-image">
          {% assign image_object = images['croco-hand.jpg'] %}
          {{
            image_object
            | image_url: width: image_object.width
            | image_tag: class: 'tw:w-full tw:h-full tw:object-contain'
          }}
        </div>
        <div class="tw:grid tw:gap-[30px] tw:lg:grid-cols-5 tw:lg:gap-[15px]">
          <div class="tw:grid tw:grid-cols-1 tw:gap-[15px] tw:md:grid-cols-2 tw:md:gap-0 tw:lg:grid-cols-1 tw:content-start">
            <div class="tw:w-full tw:h-auto content-image">
              {% assign image_object = images['instructions_1.png'] %}
              {{
                image_object
                | image_url: width: image_object.width
                | image_tag: class: 'tw:w-full tw:h-full tw:object-contain'
              }}
            </div>
            <div class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:justify-center tw:lg:justify-start tw:lg:p-[10px] tw:lg:mt-[20px]">
              <p class="tw:text-base tw:tracking-normal tw:font-bold">1. Activate your wallet</p>
              <p class="tw:text-small tw:tracking-normal tw:mt-[10px]">
                For proper operation, your brand new wallet should be activated as follows:
              </p>
              <ul class="tw:list-disc tw:text-small tw:tracking-normal tw:pl-[20px] tw:mt-[10px]">
                <li>Slide 3-5 cards together halfway into the card case</li>
                <li class="tw:mt-[5px]">
                  Move/press it about three times in both directions against the plugs (black rubber)
                </li>
              </ul>
              <p class="tw:text-small tw:tracking-normal tw:mt-[10px]">
                Here you can find an
                <a
                  class="tw:underline tw:hover:no-underline"
                  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4qPZiiObQBc&amp;list=PLXX72YVJEGpmo5P6qaNs4NwuNzSIvXnhv&amp;index=1"
                  rel="nofollow noopener"
                  ><strong>example video</strong></a
                >.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tw:grid tw:grid-cols-1 tw:gap-[15px] tw:md:grid-cols-2 tw:md:gap-0 tw:lg:grid-cols-1 tw:content-start">
            <div class="tw:w-full tw:h-auto content-image">
              {% assign image_object = images['instructions_2.jpg'] %}
              {{
                image_object
                | image_url: width: image_object.width
                | image_tag: class: 'tw:w-full tw:h-full tw:object-contain'
              }}
            </div>
            <div class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:justify-center tw:lg:justify-start tw:lg:p-[10px] tw:lg:mt-[20px]">
              <p class="tw:text-base tw:tracking-normal tw:font-bold">2. Insert cards</p>
              <p class="tw:text-small tw:tracking-normal tw:mt-[10px]">
                Press down max. 5 cards in the block until they "click".
              </p>
              <ul class="tw:list-disc tw:text-small tw:tracking-normal tw:pl-[20px] tw:mt-[10px]">
                <li>For max.5 / min.3 bank cards (mixture of max. 4 embossed + 1 flat card)</li>
                <li class="tw:mt-[5px]">Only insert cards all together, not one after the other</li>
                <li class="tw:mt-[5px]">Use only original bank cards (credit/debit)</li>
                <li class="tw:mt-[5px]">Individual cards may fall out or jam due to variations in card dimensions</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tw:grid tw:grid-cols-1 tw:gap-[15px] tw:md:grid-cols-2 tw:md:gap-0 tw:lg:grid-cols-1 tw:content-start">
            <div class="tw:w-full tw:h-auto content-image">
              {% assign image_object = images['instructions_3.jpg'] %}
              {{
                image_object
                | image_url: width: image_object.width
                | image_tag: class: 'tw:w-full tw:h-full tw:object-contain'
              }}
            </div>
            <div class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:justify-center tw:lg:justify-start tw:lg:p-[10px] tw:lg:mt-[20px]">
              <p class="tw:text-base tw:tracking-normal tw:font-bold">3. Securing the cards</p>
              <p class="tw:text-small tw:tracking-normal tw:mt-[10px]">
                Push the side button upwards to secure the cards.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tw:grid tw:grid-cols-1 tw:gap-[15px] tw:md:grid-cols-2 tw:md:gap-0 tw:lg:grid-cols-1 tw:content-start">
            <div class="tw:w-full tw:h-auto content-image">
              {% assign image_object = images['instructions_4.jpg'] %}
              {{
                image_object
                | image_url: width: image_object.width
                | image_tag: class: 'tw:w-full tw:h-full tw:object-contain'
              }}
            </div>
            <div class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:justify-center tw:lg:justify-start tw:lg:p-[10px] tw:lg:mt-[20px]">
              <p class="tw:text-base tw:tracking-normal tw:font-bold">4. Let cards fan out</p>
              <p class="tw:text-small tw:tracking-normal tw:mt-[10px]">
                Press the side button down - the cards slide out in staggered order.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tw:grid tw:grid-cols-1 tw:gap-[15px] tw:md:grid-cols-2 tw:md:gap-0 tw:lg:grid-cols-1 tw:content-start">
            <div class="tw:w-full tw:h-auto content-image">
              {% assign image_object = images['instructions_5.jpg'] %}
              {{
                image_object
                | image_url: width: image_object.width
                | image_tag: class: 'tw:w-full tw:h-full tw:object-contain'
              }}
            </div>
            <div class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:justify-center tw:lg:justify-start tw:lg:p-[10px] tw:lg:mt-[20px]">
              <p class="tw:text-base tw:tracking-normal tw:font-bold">5. Do not wear over head</p>
              <p class="tw:text-small tw:tracking-normal tw:mt-[10px]">
                Shaking the drop head is not part of a "normal" application.
              </p>
              <p class="tw:text-small tw:tracking-normal tw:mt-[10px]">
                Due to deviations in the card dimensions, individual cards may fall out or get stuck.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
